<title>JAPAN: Nippon Steel Chem - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Steel Chem - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		129.58		vs	  130.02</p>
<p> Operating	    2.76		vs	    2.86</p>
<p> Current	  prft 168 mln	  vs     loss 1.44</p>
<p> Net	    loss 16.21		vs	prft 659 mln</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 84.67 yen	  vs     prft 3.44 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    191 million	  vs	 191 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Steel Chemical Co Ltd is a petrochemical company.</p>
</text>
